    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2><br>Become the hero of a fantasy world and stop the monster invasion! <strong>Legacy of Defense</strong> combines innovative side-scrolling action with deck-building elements.<br><br>Embark on an adventure, recruit allies, and defend yourself from dangerous foes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.poster.avif?t=1755102028\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.webm?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.mp4?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Side-Scrolling Action: Experience intense battles with stunning 2D graphics and intuitive controls. Feel the thrill of defending against swarming monsters.<br><br>Deck-Building Strategy: Collect various cards to create your unique deck. Each card includes powerful skills, requiring strategic gameplay.<br><br>Fantasy Monsters: Face various fantasy monsters that you can only imagine. Battle against monsters with different abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.poster.avif?t=1755102028\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.webm?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.mp4?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Skill Upgrades: Gain experience through combat and upgrade your hero's skills. Use powerful skills to effectively clear out monsters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.poster.avif?t=1755102028\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.webm?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.mp4?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defend against incoming monsters. Choose cards to use skills and defeat enemies. Strategic deck-building is the key to victory. Clear each stage and face increasingly powerful monsters, ultimately defeating the final boss!<br><br>Test your strategy and skills. Are you ready to become a brave hero and save the fantasy world?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2><br>Become the hero of a fantasy world and stop the monster invasion! <strong>Legacy of Defense</strong> combines innovative side-scrolling action with deck-building elements.<br><br>Embark on an adventure, recruit allies, and defend yourself from dangerous foes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.poster.avif?t=1755102028\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.webm?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.mp4?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Side-Scrolling Action: Experience intense battles with stunning 2D graphics and intuitive controls. Feel the thrill of defending against swarming monsters.<br><br>Deck-Building Strategy: Collect various cards to create your unique deck. Each card includes powerful skills, requiring strategic gameplay.<br><br>Fantasy Monsters: Face various fantasy monsters that you can only imagine. Battle against monsters with different abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.poster.avif?t=1755102028\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.webm?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.mp4?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Skill Upgrades: Gain experience through combat and upgrade your hero's skills. Use powerful skills to effectively clear out monsters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.poster.avif?t=1755102028\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.webm?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.mp4?t=1755102028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defend against incoming monsters. Choose cards to use skills and defeat enemies. Strategic deck-building is the key to victory. Clear each stage and face increasingly powerful monsters, ultimately defeating the final boss!<br><br>Test your strategy and skills. Are you ready to become a brave hero and save the fantasy world?",
    "short_description": "Become the hero who protects the fantasy world and stop the monster invasion! 'Legacy of Defense' combines defense with deck-building. Build your deck, use powerful skills, gain experience, upgrade, clear stages, and defeat the final boss. Ready to test your strategy and luck?",
